@tak_dla_rozwoju_2024
# prose-audit: Grade A — Matysiak, Horała and Zandberg make the cross-party association intelligible, with retained outcomes for a faction, bounded campaign or disciplinary rupture.
title: Matysiak launches Tak! Dla Rozwoju
subtitle: A cross-party development campaign tests Razem's cultural and economic boundaries
