The launch carries one coalition delegation rather than competing party
backdrops. Clinics can explain eligibility while ministers explain the budget,
and patients do not have to perform gratitude to one component of government.

Partners bank the success together. Lewica gains room for the next negotiation
and gives up the cleanest evidence that its presence changed daily life.

- @poland_event_queue: Return the shared launch to the events desk

