KO and PSL object to commitments whose bill returns to Warsaw. We recover a
reason to vote Left in a pro-European electorate and reopen the coalition's
argument over who finances it.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the social-European line on the events desk

@eu_coalition
title: Close ranks around European normalisation
subtitle: Present rule of law and restored influence as the common victory; Razem will ask where the distinct Left programme went.
